    synonyms (eat)
  entry
    definition "take in food; used of animals only"
    examples ("This dog doesn't eat certain kinds of meat" "What do whales eat?")
    id oewn-01182162-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (feed eat)
  entry
    definition "worry or cause anxiety in a persistent way"
    examples ("What's eating you?")
    id oewn-01770125-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (eat "eat on")
  entry
    definition "use up (resources or materials)"
    examples ("this car consumes a lot of gas" "We exhausted our savings" "They run through 20 bottles of wine a week")
    id oewn-01159815-v
    partOfSpeech v
    synonyms (consume "eat up" "use up" eat deplete exhaust "run through" "wipe out" use expend)
  entry
    definition "cause to deteriorate due to the action of water, air, or an acid"
    examples ("The acid corroded the metal" "The steady dripping of water rusted the metal stopper in the sink")
    id oewn-00275082-v
